### Sign in through the admin panel and supply the session and CSRF token.
@origin = http://localhost:3000
@workspace = replace-with-workspace-uuid
@skill = replace-with-preset-skill-uuid
@session = replace-with-session-cookie
@csrf = replace-with-csrf-token

### Preset records have preset=true. Read their revision for concurrent-write checks.
GET {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspace}}/skills
Cookie: repodesk_session={{session}}

### Disable a preset. Replace version with its current revision from the catalog.
POST {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspace}}/skills/{{skill}}/action
Origin: {{origin}}
Cookie: repodesk_session={{session}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":1,"action":"disable"}

### Enable using the revision returned by the previous action.
POST {{origin}}/api/admin/workspaces/{{workspace}}/skills/{{skill}}/action
Origin: {{origin}}
Cookie: repodesk_session={{session}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":2,"action":"enable"}

### Preset edits, policy tests, publishing, rollback and archive return
### 403 preset_skill_read_only. Custom skills keep those management endpoints.
